{"alias":"/learning/II/steampowered","title":"STEAM Powered Maine","changed":"2026-07-07T18:19:18+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"STEAM PowerED Maine Banner\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Interdisciplinary%20Instruction%20-%20STEAM%20Powered%20Maine%20Landing%20Page%20Banner.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>STEAM PowerED Maine</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">STEAM PowerED Maine is a partnership between the Maine DOE and Creative Generation to support instructional design through creativity, numeracy, technology, and student-centered learning. The links below are the instructional design artifacts created by participants.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1r4Vtd1pR_wfE6oVq49yf0oBf9vCdJRlr3fpTuP_01NM/edit?usp=sharing\">Building Maps with Indi Robots</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U6OmK8KU2CfD0bJJDxIin4eOTwpgtQqWhIF6tJqfrpQ/edit?usp=sharing\">Flood Barrier Design Challenge</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QvSnGis38lffobtTESTAQN_NufjKHv7g2Zrjm7HB9oc/edit?usp=sharing\">Interactive Digestive System</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17FFG_-p6FVxHgFdosfIE4HlLIEsgAC60cu_DPh2csyY/edit?usp=sharing\">The Community Closet</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gKouOa0cMgd9kCqYPgu0EgpdtywODbtdXOBweq6zcEg/edit?usp=sharing\">Simulating the Circulatory System</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LEkiDWR65WMkhAYXrsafvzqoZ3t64VOisndjoAFrnIs/edit?usp=sharing\">Engineering for a Cause</a></li>\r\n\t<l